# Production vs experimental branches

- **`vercel-baseline`** = production. Snap, peek (`--fold-peek: 143px`), landing scroll, and spacing match the live site. Deploy and ship user-facing copy/fixes here.
- **`main`** = experimental fold-snap / tight-stack work. Do **not** deploy from `main` or merge it into `vercel-baseline` unless the user explicitly asks to bring an experiment to production.

Before portfolio scroll/snap/CSS changes, read `DEPLOYMENT.md`.

When the user asks to push or deploy to production:

1. Confirm changes are on `vercel-baseline` (or move them there).
2. Do not merge `main` into `vercel-baseline` by default.
3. After deploy, verify snap/peek still match production behavior.
